{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Slaverian Trucker is a <strong>Survival/Truck/Life simulator</strong> game where your task is to make enough money to survive and expand your wealth in the <strong>harsh semi-post apocalyptic</strong> lands of Slaveria, doing <strong>legal and illegal work</strong>, while maintaining, fixing, building, <strong>repairing</strong>, <strong>tuning</strong> your <strong>trucks</strong>, <strong>cars</strong> and other vehicles. The game focuses on <strong>freedom</strong> and allows the player to do anything that you can do in real life as well. For example: <strong>Working</strong> for companies<strong>, </strong>getting wasted<strong>, trading, smuggling</strong> illegal substances<strong>, scavenging </strong>the wasteland<strong>, drag racing, rally racing, hunting, dog racing, arm wrestling,\u00a0</strong>doing<strong> quests</strong> and <strong>tasks, </strong>finding<strong> abandoned vehicles, buying </strong>and<strong> customizing, tuning trucks/cars other vehicles.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drug smuggling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cigarette, alcohol, drug consumption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eastern European setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Day/Night Cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No GPS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Delivery jobs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scavenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hunting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drag Racing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rally Racing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quests and Tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scavenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dog racing, Arm Wrestling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Semi-Post Apocalyptic world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Authentic eastern European dirt and paved roads with AI traffic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlimited Truck/Car assembly and customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bars and shops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Role play elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Corrupt cops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Partial Controller Support (driving only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Steering wheel support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1822450?t=1771358435","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771358435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822450/332e99aa09fef7d43e4feeda69df6f3715a701cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771358435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822450/332e99aa09fef7d43e4feeda69df6f3715a701cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771358435","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Slaverian Trucker is a <strong>Survival/Truck/Life simulator</strong> game where your task is to make enough money to survive and expand your wealth in the <strong>harsh semi-post apocalyptic</strong> lands of Slaveria, doing <strong>legal and illegal work</strong>, while maintaining, fixing, building, <strong>repairing</strong>, <strong>tuning</stro